## What We Are Building

`episodes.metadata.generation_config` is the single source of truth for generation FORMAT
(provider/aspect/quality/resolution), resolved by `lib/api/resolve-generation-params.ts`.
The Episode Settings panel promises *"every video/image job honours these"*. Slice 1 (video,
prior session) made the Animator conform. **This session = Slice 2 (IMAGE)**: the image
resolver `resolveImageParams` was DEAD (never called) → image FORMAT entirely ungoverned;
the EREF executor hardcoded `EREF_QUALITY='medium'`, ignoring the episode's saved image
config (E10 had `quality=high` but rendered `medium`). Slice 2 wires provider+quality from
the episode config through the EREF executor (enforcement) + Designer/critic (awareness).

Roadmap: Slice 1 (video) ✅ · Slice 2 (image EREF) ✅ this session · Slice 3 (dispatch
override-payload) PARKED · Slice 4 (thumbnail + bible hardcodes) PARKED. Director: "не
блокеры не трогаем пока."

